    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d246">

                <pb facs="0420" n="310" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg310"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.125/75: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sheffield</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-07-24T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24,
                                1926—noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>244. Your 321, July 23, 2 p.m.<anchor n="25" xml:id="d246-f1"/> Your despatch
                    2532 has just been received.<anchor n="25" xml:id="d246-f2"/> It will be
                    entirely agreeable to this Government to <pb facs="0421" n="311" xml:id="pg311"
                    /> hold conference in Washington instead of El Paso. Please so advise Foreign
                    Office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
